<title>UK: Glynwed sells Oddbolt to Lilleshall.</title>
<headline>Glynwed sells Oddbolt to Lilleshall.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British industrial holding company Glynwed  International Plc said on Friday that it has sold its industrial fastenings  specialist business Oddbolt to a subsidiary of Lilleshall Plc for  about 500,000 stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
